# Normalise to LF everywhere.
#
# This is not a style preference. CI rebuilds dist/lorelens.js and fails the
# run if the result differs from what was committed, so if Windows checkouts
# got CRLF and the Linux runner produced LF, every pull request from a Windows
# contributor would fail a check that has nothing to do with their change.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
